{"id":567,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と国際・科学教育で育むグローカル人材","feature_description":"勝田中等教育学校は、六年間の計画的・継続的な教育を通じ、地域と世界で活躍するグローカルリーダーを育成します。探究活動、国際教育、科学教育を重点に、教科横断的な学習、個に応じた学び、課題解決型学習を展開します。課題を発見・分析・探究し、試行錯誤しながら実行する力を養うことを大切にしています。豊かな人間性、多様な人との協働、新たな創造に挑戦する姿勢を目指す教育です。","clubs":[{"id":10694,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf5da55117392dd5f9eba3c?frame_id=87&from_topics=true","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10695,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf5da55117392dd5f9eba3c?frame_id=87&from_topics=true","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10696,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf5da55117392dd5f9eba3c?frame_id=87&from_topics=true","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10697,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf5da55117392dd5f9eba3c?frame_id=87&from_topics=true","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10698,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf5da55117392dd5f9eba3c?frame_id=87&from_topics=true","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10699,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf5da55117392dd5f9eba3c?frame_id=87&from_topics=true","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10700,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf5da55117392dd5f9eba3c?frame_id=87&from_topics=true","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":10701,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.katsuta-cs.ibk.ed.jp/announcements/announcements/view/50/0cad05a16bf